<p>Argentina’s Chamber of Deputies approved a labor reform bill backed by President Javier Milei on Friday, one day after unions staged a nationwide strike to protest the changes. The legislation now moves to the Senate for a final vote. Supporters describe the reform as part of a broader push to loosen rules they say discourage hiring and investment. Unions and critics counter that it weakens worker protections and shifts leverage toward employers.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Bill framing: WSWS calls the package Milei’s “Labor Modernization Law” and casts it as a major counterreform, not modernization.</li><li>Layoff and wage-cut warnings: WSWS says the lower house vote would “clear the way” for mass layoffs, wage cuts and workplace abuse.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Argentine government and Milei allies: Present the reform as labor-market liberalization—loosening rules they argue discourage hiring and investment—as part of Milei’s broader economic agenda. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/argentinas-lower-house-passes-labor-reform-before-final-senate-vote'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>Argentine unions: Say Milei’s reform is meant to erode worker protections, and they have opposed it on those grounds. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/20/argentinas-chamber-of-deputies-passes-controversial-labour-reform-bill'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>World Socialist Web Site: Calls the measure a historic rollback of labor rights that would clear the way for mass layoffs and wage cuts, and says the strike was insufficient to stop it. (<a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/02/21/bdeb-f21.html'>WSWS</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/02/21/bdeb-f21.html'>National strike in Argentina fails to halt historic labor counterreform and mass layoffs</a> - wsws.org</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/argentinas-lower-house-passes-labor-reform-before-final-senate-vote'>Argentina&#x27;s lower house passes labor reform despite strike</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/20/argentinas-chamber-of-deputies-passes-controversial-labour-reform-bill'>Argentina’s Chamber of Deputies passes controversial labour reform bill</a> - aljazeera.com</li></ul>